Cyberpunk style: A futuristic Singapore skyline at dusk, neon-drenched skyscrapers reflecting off Marina Bay waters. In the foreground, thousands of glowing holographic butterflies emerge from cocoons attached to brutalist concrete buildings, their wings pulsing with electric blues and magentas. The butterflies swarm upward in a spiral pattern, breaking through a ceiling of dark storm clouds into golden light above. Digital rain falls in the background while citizens below look upward with faces illuminated by the butterfly glow. The atmosphere conveys emergence, awakening, and transformation—a society breaking free from constraints into vibrant new possibilities.
